00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:34.620
- [Ryley] Yeah.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:38.310
- [Interviewer] In a tent?

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:39.960
- [Ryley] Recently, no.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:41.310
- [Interviewer] You're just-

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.950
- [Ryley] I've been here and there

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:48.200
at people's places, in
apartments or on the street.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.763
Rarely in apartments, maybe twice a week.

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:54.100
Mainly on the streets, at buddies' places

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:59.100
because it's just been
real dangerous lately.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.540
(Ryley laughs)

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:03.910
- [Interviewer] At night down
here is a very different scene

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:04.743
than during the day.

00:10:04.743 --> 00:10:05.576
- [Ryley] Yeah.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:07.820
Yeah. It's scary, man.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.450
And you better make sure that
you don't fuck anyone over

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:17.120
because people have ability
to make things happen,

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.220
that would be out of anyone's imagination.

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:21.310
And it's really scary.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:33.190
- [Interviewer] Addiction
is such a, perplexing thing

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.740
for an outsider to watch

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:38.080
'cause it's like,

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:42.640
I see very clearly how you
could be living a great life

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.150
with your kid, with your, you know,

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:46.670
repair the relationship with your ex,

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.503
get everything together.

00:10:47.503 --> 00:10:49.780
Do whatever it takes to
get your life together

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:52.530
and you have the blocks that you have,

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.270
that you're experiencing
right now are so strong

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:55.610
that you just can't.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:56.943
You're smart enough to figure that out,

00:10:56.943 --> 00:10:59.203
but you just can't, it seems.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:01.620
- Yeah.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:04.740
I even have somebody that's
willing to come pick me up

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:08.010
at any time within a day's notice

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.760
to take me to Orange County.

00:11:12.394 --> 00:11:14.110
