00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:28.523
- Yeah. I think I'm just afraid.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.720
- [Interviewer] But what
I'm learning with every,

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:32.380
all of these issues that you see,

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:35.190
all these problems people are
experiencing on my channel,

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:39.483
that courage is very close
to the core of all of it.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:44.030
You know, lack of courage stops you,

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.080
the fear of what might happen,
the fear of getting clean.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.120
The fear of living,
being successful in life

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:49.189
and being fulfilled.

00:11:49.189 --> 00:11:50.583
- It's uncomfortable.

00:11:50.583 --> 00:11:53.702
- [Interviewer] Is it
because you don't deserve it,

00:11:53.702 --> 00:11:55.233
you feel like you don't deserve it?

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.922
