I deserved everything.

00:11:59.922 --> 00:12:03.380
I used to feel like I deserved
a lot more than I got.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:07.760
And, at this point where I'm at now,

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.505
I do think I deserve a little
bit more than I have but-

00:12:10.505 --> 00:12:11.810
(Interviewer laughs)

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:12.643
- [Interviewer] Yeah.

00:12:12.643 --> 00:12:13.800
(Ryley laughs)

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:16.203
- But I also put myself
in these situations.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:21.003
I could be gone, I mean, fuck,
I walk like nine miles a day.

00:12:22.578 --> 00:12:25.363
I could be out of LA in a day, you know,

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.313
it's not that hard.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:36.270
But the lifestyle is just it
becomes such a routinely thing

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.510
and you start making friends with people.

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.780
And when I came back
here I was very welcomed

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:48.456
