00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.283
Everyone was really happy to see me,

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:57.270
but I think it was for the wrong reasons.

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:04.990
But you know, we're in
it together, out there,

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:06.870
you know what I mean?

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:08.010
And the people who live out here

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.410
that have it better than us.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.980
They really have a hard time understanding

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:18.193
or even wanting to connect thoughts like,

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:21.070
they don't wanna connect with me.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:25.110
They don't want to understand
what it's like for me

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:31.220
who was much recently in
their shoes, now homeless

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:34.320
which a lot of people are
becoming because of Coronavirus.

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:38.460
But people are starting
to figure out that,

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.300
soon I mean, if shit gets
worse with Coronavirus

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.500
and all that stuff, a
lot more people are going

